<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bancorp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bancorp.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Dain Bosworth analyst Ben Crabtree said he initiated coverage of Mercantile Bancorp Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>- Crabtree noted that Mercantile has announced two acquisitions, Mark Twain Bancshares Inc and Roosevelt Financial Group Inc, which should increase the bank holding company's market share and strengthen its product lines.</p>
<p>- Shares of Mercantile were trading up 3/4 to 54-1/4.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
